{
 "format": "damap",
 "version": 1,
 "id": "1ab",
 "name": "Croc Maze",
 "file": "Map1ab_Croc_Maze.xml",
 "rooms": [
  {"id":1,"x":50,"y":390,"z":0,"title":"The Marsh, Stone Road","descriptions":["Dirt meets stone here as a road begins its winding journey north along a cut-out hillside shrouded by a grove of trees. Just a few hundred feet north a large growth of reeds forces a jog to the northwest.  In a clump of weeds sits a makeshift stone bench and small pile of stones.  If it was once a shrine, someone has long since removed the statue and abandoned its care."],"exits":[{"to":2,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":0,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":2,"x":50,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"The Marsh, Stone Road","descriptions":["Tapping your foot on the ground, the hardness of stone confirms you are on the road.  You feel your way about searching for the hillside to the west or the reeds to the east.  Once oriented, a sense of calm returns and you consider your options.","The stones of the road fit seamlessly together, locked to each other without mortar.  Traces of rust form two paths in this curve where the iron rims of the wagon wheels have paid the price of taking the turn too fast.  A bullfrog croaks out his presence somewhere in the tall reeds that line the road.  The shade of the trees to the northwest is alluring yet daunting."],"exits":[{"to":1,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":3,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":8,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":3,"x":20,"y":330,"z":0,"title":"The Marsh, Stone Road","descriptions":["Tapping your foot on the ground, the hardness of stone confirms you are on the road.  You feel your way about, searching for the hillside to the west or the reeds to the east.  Once oriented, a sense of calm returns and you consider your options.","Gnats swarm annoyingly about your head, prompting you to bat at them with your hand in vain.  To the north, you can see where the road leaves the shadows and enters the safety of daylight about a half a mile away.  Curving to the southeast, the road leads you to the closest exit for this grove.  Moss clings to the stones of the road where it meets the water and reeds to the east."],"exits":[{"to":4,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":2,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":24,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":4,"x":20,"y":300,"z":0,"title":"The Marsh, Stone Road","descriptions":["Tapping your foot on the ground, the hardness of stone confirms you are on the road.  You feel your way about searching for the hillside to the west or the reeds to the east.  Once oriented, a sense of calm returns and you consider your options.","Some reeds have been hacked away close to the road, undoubtedly destined to become someone's new basket.  The removal has left an opening in the reeds allowing you to peer into the marsh on the other side which seemingly waits for its next victim.  A water beetle that is traveling through the mud stops and waves its feelers at you in what seems to be a challenge before continuing on its way."],"exits":[{"to":5,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":3,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":9,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":5,"x":20,"y":270,"z":0,"title":"The Marsh, Stone Road","descriptions":["Tapping your foot on the ground, the hardness of stone confirms you are on the road.  You feel your way about searching for the hillside to the west or the reeds to the east.  Once oriented, a sense of calm returns and you consider your options.","The lack of direct sunlight here is daunting.  You can't seem to suppress the notion this is the perfect place for highway bandits to ply their trade.  Squinting at the deeper shadows, you search the area for possible ambush locations and poke at the reeds just to make sure.  A quick glance north and south confirms you are in the middle of the grove."],"exits":[{"to":6,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":4,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":10,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":6,"x":20,"y":150,"z":0,"title":"The Marsh, Stone Road","descriptions":["High reeds create a thick wall to the southeast. A makeshift target is tacked to the closest tree.  Someone has been practicing their archery, and on closer inspection you see the arrowheads that are now and forever a part of the tree. To the northwest you see a large bridge now in ruin, which used to span the river.  To the south the road heads directly into the shadows of a grove of trees."],"exits":[{"to":5,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":7,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":11,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":7,"x":0,"y":130,"z":0,"title":"The Marsh, Stone Road","descriptions":["A large stone bridge that once spanned the expanse of the river here, now lays in ruin.  The town of Riverhaven, the bridge's orginal destination, sits on the other side.  Gazing at the town, the orange glow of the town's street torches forms an eerie dome in the night sky.  To the southeast, a wall of reeds creeps down from a group of trees into the river and attempts to survive the currents of the river.","A large stone bridge that once spanned the expanse of the river here, now lays in ruin.  The town of Riverhaven, the bridge's original destination, sits on the other side.  Gazing at the town, you notice a haze of brown lingers in the air, no doubt the result of the forges and smoke houses at work.  To the southeast, a wall of reeds creeps down from a group of trees into the river and attempts to survive its currents."],"exits":[{"to":6,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FFFFFF"},
  {"id":8,"x":90,"y":360,"z":0,"title":"The Marsh, In The Water","descriptions":["The darkness about you is absolute.  Discerning the objects about requires they be inches from your face.  Feeling your way about you touch fur, then realize it is cold wet moss.  Something bumps into you causing you to jump back ready to defend yourself, then realize you've walked into a tree.  Out of the corner of your eye you think you see something move, then realize it's just your mind playing tricks on you in the absence of vision."],"exits":[{"to":12,"exit":"go","move":"","hidden":true},{"to":34,"exit":"go","move":"","hidden":true},{"to":34,"exit":"go","move":""},{"to":50,"exit":"go","move":"","hidden":true},{"to":56,"exit":"go","move":"","hidden":true},{"to":51,"exit":"go","move":"","hidden":true},{"to":38,"exit":"go","move":"","hidden":true},{"to":17,"exit":"go","move":"","hidden":true},{"to":3,"exit":"go","move":""}],"color":"#FF8000"},
